I come out of the market lane.
There is a lot of crowd in the market.
But I am very happy.
My cloth bags are heavy.
There are fresh vegetables and fruits in the bags.
I also have new spices.
I walk towards my building.
Now I understand the market prices well.
I ask the shopkeepers with confidence.
"How much is this?" or "What is the price?"
Now this is easy for me.
I reach near my building.
I go up by the lift.
I come to the door of my house.
I put the beautiful marigold garland on the door.
It looks very nice.
I go inside the house.
I put the bags down.
I have fresh vegetables for tonight.
I am excited for dinner.
